tement.", "difficulty": "Medium"}, {"id": "q-b-2", "text": "Find the roots of the quadratic equation sqrt(3)x^2 + 10x + 7*sqrt(3) = 0 by factorisation.", "bloom": "Apply", "marks": 2, "rubric": "1 mark for splitting middle term 3x + 7x; 1 mark for correct roots x = -sqrt(3), -7/sqrt(3).", "difficulty": "Medium"}], "section_id": "sec-b", "marks_per_q": 2, "instructions": "Questions 21 to 25 carry 2 marks each with very short answers."}, {"name": "Section C", "type": "short_answer_2", "questions": [{"id": "q-c-1", "text": "Prove that: (sin theta - 2 sin^3 theta) / (2 cos^3 theta - cos theta) = tan theta.", "bloom": "Analyze", "marks": 3, "rubric": "1 mark for taking common terms; 1 mark for identity substitution; 1 mark for simplifying to tan theta.", "difficulty": "Medium"}], "section_id": "sec-c", "marks_per_q": 3, "instructions": "Questions 26 to 31 carry 3 marks each with short answers."}]', '2026-09-28', '8686c867-ad32-480e-87a7-6454f4d185d2', 'scheduled', '2026-09-16 19:14:55.333909+05:30', '2026-09-16 19:14:55.333909+05:30');
